# Plan website sync

When you complete (or substantially ship) work in this repo:

1. **Parity checklist** — if a matching task exists in `roadmap/plan/index.html`, mark it `done: true` (and `badge: "Expo"` for Expo parity).
2. **New tab (required)** — also log the addition under the `new` section, in today’s date group (`id: new-YYYY-MM-DD`, title via `nl-BE` date). Prefer editing `DEFAULT_SECTIONS` so `mergeDefaultsIntoSections()` picks it up for all clients:
   ```js
   { id: "chg-YYYYMMDD-short-slug", title: "Korte omschrijving", done: true, badge: "Expo", date: "YYYY-MM-DD" }
   ```
   Newest day groups stay on top; newest tasks first within the day.
3. **Deploy without waiting for the user to ask:**
   ```bash
   python3 roadmap/deploy.py
   ```
4. Mention `https://gustra.net/plan/` briefly in the reply.

Do this in the same turn as the implementation for every finished addition.

Also regenerate `GUSTRA_UNIVERSAL_FULL.txt` after app code changes via `python3 scripts/dump-full-config.py` (see `full-config-dump` rule).
